# Folder 3 - Certificates

This folder contains all certificates earned through the prescribed courses and programme requirements.

## Contents

- Coursera Course Certificates
- Other Relevant Certificates

## Coursera Certificates

All certificates earned after completing the prescribed Coursera courses will be added to this folder.

## Other Certificates

Any other certificates relevant to the programme requirements will be added here.

## Certificate Organization

Certificates will be clearly named according to the course or certificate title for easy identification and verification.
